# KQM Vodyanitsa quick guide, Neuvillette team (Xilonen version): the
# Escoffier version's rotation, Neuvillette E > Furina ED N3 > Escoffier
# EQ > Vodyanitsa EQ > Furina Q > Neuvillette C E C Q > Escoffier E N1 >
